{"number":112,"name":"سُورَةُ الإِخۡلَاصِ","englishName":"Al-Ikhlaas","englishNameTranslation":"Sincerity","revelationType":"Meccan","numberOfAyahs":4,"ayahs":[{"number":6222,"numberInSurah":1,"juz":30,"page":604,"textUthmani":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6222.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6222.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"قل -أيها الرسول-: هو الله المتفرد بالألوهية والربوبية والأسماء والصفات، لا يشاركه أحد فيها.","translationEn":"Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One,","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6223,"numberInSurah":2,"juz":30,"page":604,"textUthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6223.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6223.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"الله وحده المقصود في قضاء الحوائج والرغائب.","translationEn":"Allah, the Eternal Refuge.","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6224,"numberInSurah":3,"juz":30,"page":604,"textUthmani":"لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6224.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6224.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"ليس له ولد ولا والد ولا صاحبة.","translationEn":"He neither begets nor is born,","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6225,"numberInSurah":4,"juz":30,"page":604,"textUthmani":"وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6225.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6225.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"ولم يكن له مماثلا ولا مشابهًا أحد من خلقه، لا في أسمائه ولا في صفاته، ولا في أفعاله، تبارك وتعالى وتقدَّس.","translationEn":"Nor is there to Him any equivalent.\"","transliterationEn":""}]}